{"id":"661872","name":"剁椒肉沫魔芋","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/661872/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"魔芋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"肉沫","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"肉沫提前剁碎备用。","img":"images/661872/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"泡椒泡姜清洗后切碎。","img":"images/661872/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜头拍扁剁碎备用。","img":"images/661872/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"魔芋冲洗后改刀切块。","img":"images/661872/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中热油放入肉沫，翻炒均匀炒干水份。","img":"images/661872/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量蚝油将肉沫炒香。","img":"images/661872/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入蒜末。","img":"images/661872/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入泡椒泡姜。","img":"images/661872/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入剁椒，翻炒均匀炒出香味。","img":"images/661872/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入魔芋。","img":"images/661872/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻炒均匀。","img":"images/661872/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/661872/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"适量老抽上色，煮开后焖五分钟左右入味。","img":"images/661872/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"出锅前加入葱花即可。","img":"images/661872/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661872/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661872/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661872/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}